+      <section class="doc-section" id="authentication" data-title="身份鉴权 认证 Bearer Token API Key Authorization">
+        <h2 class="section-title"><span class="section-icon"><svg><use href="#i-lock"/></svg></span>身份鉴权<a class="hash" href="#authentication" aria-label="身份鉴权的链接">#</a></h2>
+        <p class="description">所有 API 请求均使用 <span class="inline-code">Bearer Token</span> 进行身份验证。将你的 API Key 放入请求头的 <span class="inline-code">Authorization</span> 字段，即可访问已授权的资源。</p>
+        <div class="codeblock"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-label"><svg><use href="#i-code"/></svg>请求头</span><button class="copy-icon" data-copy="Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY&#10;Content-Type: application/json" aria-label="复制鉴权请求头"><svg><use href="#i-copy"/></svg>复制</button></div><pre><span class="key">Authorization</span>: Bearer <span class="string">YOUR_API_KEY</span>
